;TURN.LSP layer settings
;By Thomas Gail Haws
;
;TURN-LAYERS.DAT
;
;Use this file to change TURN layer names, colors, or linetypes.
;Put it anywhere on your AutoCAD support file search path. TURN finds it with
;(findfile). If TURN cannot find it, the built-in defaults below are used and
;everything still works, so this file is optional.
;
;Format, one entry per line:
;    ("KEY"  "LAYER NAME"  "COLOR"  "LINETYPE")
;
;KEY is <segment stem>-<role>.
;  Segment stem:  TRCK  the powered unit
;                 TRL1  the first trailer
;                 TRL2  the second trailer, and so on
;  Role:          BODY       body outline plotted at intervals
;                 FRNT-LEFT  guide axle left tire path
;                 FRNT-RGHT  guide axle right tire path
;                 REAR-LEFT  trailing axle left tire path
;                 REAR-RGHT  trailing axle right tire path
;                 HTCH       path of the hitch towing the next segment
;                 CRNR       body corner swept paths
;
;One role belongs to the whole vehicle rather than to a segment, and its key
;is the bare role with no stem:
;                 ENVL       swept path envelope of the whole vehicle
;
;An empty linetype means Continuous. Do NOT name a linetype that is not loaded
;in the drawing: -LAYER will reject it and you will silently lose the layer.
;That is what cost TURN 1.1.9 users their tire paths.
;
;Only list the keys you want to change. Anything absent uses the default,
;which is "C-TURN-" plus the key.
;
;Defaults, listed here so you can see the shape. Uncomment and edit to change.
;
;("TRCK-BODY"      "C-TURN-TRCK-BODY"       "1"  "")
;("TRCK-FRNT-LEFT" "C-TURN-TRCK-FRNT-LEFT"  "1"  "")
;("TRCK-FRNT-RGHT" "C-TURN-TRCK-FRNT-RGHT"  "1"  "")
;("TRCK-REAR-LEFT" "C-TURN-TRCK-REAR-LEFT"  "2"  "")
;("TRCK-REAR-RGHT" "C-TURN-TRCK-REAR-RGHT"  "2"  "")
;("TRCK-HTCH"      "C-TURN-TRCK-HTCH"       "3"  "")
;("TRCK-CRNR"      "C-TURN-TRCK-CRNR"       "6"  "")
;("ENVL"           "C-TURN-ENVL"            "4"  "")
;("TRL1-BODY"      "C-TURN-TRL1-BODY"       "1"  "")
;("TRL1-REAR-LEFT" "C-TURN-TRL1-REAR-LEFT"  "2"  "")
;
;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
;LEGACY NAMES
;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
;TURN 1.1.x used names that predate the four-character-field rule of the
;National CAD Standard, and it had no third segment. If you have existing
;drawings or layer filters built on the old names, uncomment this block to get
;them back. New segments beyond the first trailer have no legacy equivalent
;and will keep their TRL2, TRL3 ... names.
;
;("TRCK-BODY"      "C-TURN-TRCK-BODY"             "1"  "")
;("TRCK-FRNT-LEFT" "C-TURN-TRCK-FRONT-LEFT-PATH"  "1"  "")
;("TRCK-FRNT-RGHT" "C-TURN-TRCK-FRONT-RGHT-PATH"  "1"  "")
;("TRCK-REAR-LEFT" "C-TURN-TRCK-REAR-LEFT-PATH"   "2"  "")
;("TRCK-REAR-RGHT" "C-TURN-TRCK-REAR-RGHT-PATH"   "2"  "")
;("TRCK-HTCH"      "C-TURN-HTCH-PATH"             "3"  "")
;("TRL1-BODY"      "C-TURN-TRAL-BODY"             "4"  "")
;("TRL1-REAR-LEFT" "C-TURN-TRAL-REAR-LEFT-PATH"   "4"  "")
;("TRL1-REAR-RGHT" "C-TURN-TRAL-REAR-RGHT-PATH"   "4"  "")
